flowchart LR
    A[Contract v2<br/>+ Day 16 backend] --> B[paired manifest]
    B --> C[100K screening<br/>DQN + Double DQN]
    C --> D[250K pilot<br/>seed 11 pair]
    D --> E{pilot gate<br/>correctness / stability / performance}
    E -- fail --> X[保留 incomplete<br/>禁止 ranking]
    E -- pass --> F[500K main<br/>seeds 11 / 22 / 33<br/>sequential]
    F --> G[training metrics<br/>+ CUDA runtime metadata]
    F --> H[Contract v2 evaluation<br/>epsilon 0 + raw reward]
    F --> I[fixed probe states<br/>Q / max-Q diagnostics]
    G --> J[只聚合 completed runs<br/>actual transitions = target]
    H --> J
    I --> J
    J --> K{paired seed<br/>方向一致?}
    K -- yes --> L[A / B<br/>evidence-supported direction]
    K -- no --> M[C / D<br/>variance 或 500K 仍不足]
